  "_readme": "Edit this file to change checklists. Section 'items' are rated 1-5 (or N/A) and feed the scores. 'fields' are plain form inputs. 'repeater' is a list of entries (units, buildings, capex items, open items). Field types: text, textarea, number, percent, currency, date, select, segmented. Keep ids unique and stable once you have saved inspections (ids link saved answers to items). Bump 'version' and the CACHE name in sw.js when you deploy changes. Segmented fields with \"sticky\": true can't be un-selected by tapping again. 'company' is the default report header name (Settings can override it).",
